abstract: >
  Leakage-resistant insider-threat detection system using the CERT r4.2
  dataset. Features a frozen LightGBM model (lgbm-graph-v1) with 12
  features (8 behavioral + 4 graph), conformal uncertainty estimation,
  SHAP explanations, and a deterministic Phase 20 decision engine.
  Adaptive Risk was evaluated and rejected for production.
